id=ims_sms_restore
name=IMS / SMS Restore (KDDI povo / au)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=trprkkk
description=Re-enables org.codeaurora.ims and reinstalls com.qti.phone for user 0 after boot. Restores SMS over IMS on KDDI povo/au when a previous crash workaround disabled those packages. May not apply to ROMs with different IMS package names.
